 search and streamlined checkout, boosting sales during peak academic enrollment seasons.","keyMetrics":[{"label":"Organic Search Growth","value":"+340%","sub":"Top rankings for medical entrance textbooks"},{"label":"Search Latency","value":"0.8s","sub":"Instant multi-attribute faceted indexing"},{"label":"Cart Abandonment Drop","value":"-42%","sub":"Frictionless one-page checkout"},{"label":"Monthly Readers","value":"250K+","sub":"Active students & professionals"}],"challenge":"The previous monolithic bookstore suffered from severe slowdowns when thousands of students searched for specialized medical entrance textbooks simultaneously. Cart abandonment was above 70% due to multi-step checkout friction, and inventory synchronization across multiple distributors was failing.","solution":"We designed a high-velocity, conversion-centered eCommerce architecture. We implemented an instant predictive search engine capable of searching by ISBN, author, syllabus, and subject in under 0.8 seconds. We designed a clean, mobile-first buying flow with one-tap UPI, NetBanking, and COD options, coupled with automated WhatsApp shipping updates.","deliverables":["Custom High-Speed eCommerce Platform","Instant Predictive Search & ISBN Filtering","One-Page Mobile Checkout with UPI & COD","Automated WhatsApp & SMS Order Tracking","Technical eCommerce SEO & Schema Markup"],"testimonial":{"quote":"Our peak admissions season used to bring our store to its knees. Accelerance redesigned our platform with incredible speed and elegance. Our sales spiked by 340% and our customer support calls dropped in half.","author":"Rajesh S.","role":"Operations Director, MyBooksFactory"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Medical, Engineering & Academic Books at Lowest Prices","searchPlaceholder":"Search by Book Title, Author, MBBS, BDS, NEET PG, ISBN...","highlights":["40,000+ Verified Academic Titles","Fast Express Shipping Pan-India","100% Genuine Publisher Guarantees"],"featuredCategories":["Medical & Dental","Engineering Tech","Nursing & Pharma","Competitive Exam Guides"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"eCommerce & Academic Publishing"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["MyBooksFactory"," — ","Mybooksfactory.com"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"MyBooksFactory specializes in medical (MBBS, BDS), engineering, and competitive examination textbooks. We re-engineered their eCommerce platform to handle 40,000+ SKUs with sub-second catalog search and streamlined checkout, boosting sales during peak academic enrollment seasons."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/mybooksfactory/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}],["$","div","designer-handle",{"className":"approach-card home-service-card","style":{"padding":"2rem"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":["$","$L5",null,{"caseStudy":{"id":"designer-handle","slug":"designer-handle","client":"Designer Handle UK","url":"https://designerhandle.co.uk","domain":"Designerhandle.co.uk","title":"Architectural Ironmongery & Hardware Platform with Real-Time Finish Filtering","subtitle":"High-spec interior hardware eCommerce with trade accounts, finish matching, and CAD specifications.","industry":"Interior Architecture & Trade eCommerce","category":"ecommerce","region":"United Kingdom","themeColor":"#27272A","accentColor":"#EAB308","heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","screenshotImage":"/images/case-studies/designerhandle-screenshot.png","iconImage":"/images/case-studies/icons/designerhandle-icon.svg","summary":"Designer Handle supplies luxury door handles, cabinet hardware, and architectural ironmongery to UK architects, interior designers, and discerning homeowners. We developed a sophisticated catalog with live finish previewing and dedicated trade client portals.","keyMetrics":[{"label":"Organic Search Revenue","value":"+210%","sub":"High-intent interior design queries"},{"label":"Repeat B2B Trade Orders","value":"+74%","sub":"Architect & contractor account portal"},{"label":"SKU Combinations","value":"55,000+","sub":"Managed with sub-second filter speed"},{"label":"Mobile Bounce Rate","value":"-38%","sub":"Fast visual gallery exploration"}],"challenge":"Architectural hardware has endless complexity: each handle comes in 6+ finishes (Satin Brass, Antique Bronze, Matte Black, Polished Chrome) and requires matching hinges, latches, and escutcheons. Customers were confused by disorganized options, and trade professionals lacked an easy way to specify whole-house schedules.","solution":"We built an intuitive, visual-first shopping experience. Users can toggle finishes across entire hardware collections simultaneously. We created a 'Project Hardware Scheduler' allowing architects to group selections by room, download PDF specifications for clients, and receive automatic trade volume discounts.","deliverables":["Custom Architectural eCommerce Platform","Dynamic Multi-Variant Finish Visualizer","Architect & Interior Designer Trade Portal","Room-by-Room Hardware Schedule Generator","Technical Product Schema & Fast UK Shipping Logic"],"testimonial":{"quote":"Specifying ironmongery used to be a headache for our architect clients. The new platform makes pairing finishes effortless. Our trade accounts have surged, and online revenue has more than doubled.","author":"James Thornton","role":"Commercial Director, Designer Handle UK"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Architectural Door Handles & Luxury Interior Ironmongery","searchPlaceholder":"Search by Finish (Satin Brass, Matte Black, Antique Bronze)...","highlights":["Solid Brass & Marine Grade 316 Stainless Steel","Trade Discount Accounts for Architects & Builders","Next-Day Dispatch Across the UK"],"featuredCategories":["Interior Door Handles","Cabinet Knobs & Pulls","Matching Locks & Hinges","Architectural Window Fittings"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"Interior Architecture & Trade eCommerce"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["Designer Handle UK"," — ","Designerhandle.co.uk"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Designer Handle supplies luxury door handles, cabinet hardware, and architectural ironmongery to UK architects, interior designers, and discerning homeowners. We developed a sophisticated catalog with live finish previewing and dedicated trade client portals."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/designer-handle/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"faq-compact-section","style":{"background":"var(--bg-secondary)","borderTop":"1px solid var(--border-light)"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"textAlign":"center","maxWidth":700,"margin":"0 auto"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-label","children":"Clear Answers"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"faq-container-list","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"faq-item-card","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"faq-q-title","children":"What eCommerce platforms do you work with?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"faq-a-desc","children":"We are platform-agnostic and select the best engine for your operational n